WTHU 1450 AM Thurmont, MD	Nestled up in the beautiful Catoctin Mountains in northern Frederick County, our 51 year old radio station is unlike any on the radio.   We are dedicated to sharing music you remember…..but not the music you hear on other oldies stations.  We play the flip side hits…the ones that you can sing along to.  Songs by The Beatles, Beach Boys, BTO, Fleetwood Mac, the Rolling Stones Three Dog Night, Bob Seger, Roy Orbison, Bruce Springsteen, Creedence and many more!  We’re taking you back to the COOL music of the 50s, 60s, 70s and 80s.  We want to serve our local community with music, weather, traffic and community events and restore local radio to the way we’ve all always loved and remembered it.  We are committed to returning you to a time that was simple and very cool.	Oldies	USA	English	http://stream.cool1450amwthu.com:9888/stream/1/	-	-	-	-	-
